{"title":"《工程建设项目招标代理机构管理暂行办法》发布 2026年1月1日起施行（附解读）","date":"2025-10-31","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong>《工程建设项目招标代理机构管理暂行办法》发布</strong></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong>2026年1月1日起施行（附解读）</strong></h1>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;width:100%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:un